/E (An Ombuds \(also referred to as Ombudsman and Ombudsperson\) is a resource available to every MSA member and everyone attending the annual conference. Ombuds listen and help identify concerns, navigate issues, illuminate pathways, problem solve, and address conflict. We help untangle the often-complicated terrain of decision-making toward satisfactory resolution for any matter that impacts your experience within a professional community.)
